格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Gitee AI 员工：在 issue 里 @ 机器人并指定目标分支，它自动克隆仓库开发、提交 PR，可自动合并并关闭 issue。Issue-driven Gitee AI developer for DeepSeek Harness.","id":"gh:1344702556","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"gitee-ai-employee","slug":"wangbobo-coder/gitee-ai-employee","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Gitee AI 员工：在 issue 里 @ 机器人并指定目标分支，它自动克隆仓库开发、提交 PR，可自动合并并关闭 issue。Issue-driven Gitee AI developer fo"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" 里 @ 机器人并指定目标分支，它自动克隆仓库开发、提交 PR，可自动合并并关闭 issue。Issue-driven Gitee AI developer for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Gitee AI 员工 (gitee-ai-employee)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"An issue-driven AI developer for **DeepSeek Harness**, working against **Gitee (码云)** and **GitHub**"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"n issue-driven AI developer for **DeepSeek Harness**, working against **Gitee (码云)** and **GitHub**."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Mention your bot in an issue, and the plugin clones the repository, dispatches an\nAI **worker agent*"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"* to implement the change, pushes a branch, opens a Pull Request to the\nbranch you ask for, and can "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"auto-merge and auto-close the issue. You can watch Gitee and\nGitHub repositories at the same time."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> 中文说明见 README.zh.md。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Polling**: periodically scans the issues of the repositories you watch for a new\nmention of your"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" bot (`@botName`). Dual platform: each watch row can be prefixed\n`gitee:` or `github:` (unprefixed r"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ows use `defaultPlatform`, default `gitee`), so you can\nwatch both platforms at once.\n- **AI develop"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ment**: creates a worker agent in a profile that clones the repo (via\nPowerShell + `curl` on Windows"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"), explores it, implements the issue, runs checks, and\ncommits on a `ai-fix/issue-<number>` branch.\n"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"- **Branch-aware**: it reads branch instructions written in natural language and uses that\nbranch as"},{"id":"p7s7","text":" both the development base and the PR target:\n- `需要修改 release-v1.2 分支` / `修改 X 分支` / `改 X 分支`\n- `基于 "},{"id":"p7s8","text":"X 分支` / `在 X 分支上` / `以 X 分支为基础`\n- `合并到 X` / `合到 X` / `目标分支 X` / `base: X`\nThe requested branch is va"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"lidated against the remote with `git ls-remote`; if it does not\nexist, the plugin falls back to the "},{"id":"p7s10","text":"repository default branch and says so in a comment.\n- **PR & close**: pushes the branch, creates a P"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"R (base = the chosen branch), optionally\nauto-merges it (`autoMerge`), and optionally closes the iss"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"ue on success (`autoCloseIssue`).\n- **Webhook / manual trigger**: optional webhook endpoint and a ma"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"nual trigger URL for\ninstant processing without waiting for the poll.\n- **Security scanning (v1.2)**"},{"id":"p7s14","text":": configure scan repositories (`scanRepos`) and the plugin\ndrives a scan worker (reusing the DSH mod"},{"id":"p7s15","text":"el) through built-in/custom security prompts to\nstatically audit the cloned code. Findings are **ded"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"uplicated** — the same spot\n(`file:line` + vulnerability type) is only reported once (dedup state pe"},{"id":"p7s17","text":"rsists at\n`workRoot/scan-state.json`) — and new findings are submitted as issues automatically.\nSupp"},{"id":"p7s18","text":"orts scheduled scanning (`scanEnabled` + `scanIntervalMs`) and manual triggering\n(the \"立即扫描\" button "},{"id":"p7s19","text":"in the settings card or `POST /gitee-ai/scan`)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness (dsh) 0.1.x, Windows (the plugin drives `git` and the Gitee API through\nPowerShel"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"l + `C:\\Windows\\System32\\curl.exe`), a Gitee account with a personal access token.\n- The worker and "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"scanner presets are **bundled and auto-installed** into\n`$DSH_HOME/.agent-presets/gitee-worker` (`gi"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"tee-scanner` likewise) on first load — no manual setup."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"(or if you prefer installing straight from GitHub: `dsh plugin --profile <p> add github:wangbobo-cod"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"er/gitee-ai-employee`)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Restart dsh, then open **Settings → Plugins → Plugin configuration**, find the\n**Gitee AI 员工** card "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"hen open **Settings → Plugins → Plugin configuration**, find the\n**Gitee AI 员工** card and configure:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Setting | Meaning |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Security scanning (v1.2)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. In the plugin config card (or `/gitee-ai/settings`), fill **扫描仓库** with one\n`[gitee:|github:]owne"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"r/repo` per line, enable **启用定时扫描**, or click **立即扫描全部仓库**.\nClick **一键获取我的仓库** to auto-fill every re"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"po you can access (own + org memberships)\nso you can keep/remove entries before saving (equivalent A"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"PI: `GET /gitee-ai/my-repos`).\n2. The plugin clones the repo → runs the scan worker with the selecte"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"d security prompts →\nresults land at `<repo>/.gitee-scan/result.json` → findings are diffed against\n"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"`scan-state.json` → **new** findings are submitted as an issue."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Built-in prompt ids**: `general` / `sqli` / `xss` / `command-injection` / `path-traversal` /\n`ssrf"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"` / `hardcoded-secret` / `insecure-deserialization` / `authz` / `dos` / `dependency`."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- Override a built-in by using the same id in `scanPrompts`; add custom ids for new checks.\n- Dedup "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"signature is `file:line:vulnType`; already-reported signatures are skipped.\n- `POST /gitee-ai/scan` "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"accepts `dryRun=true` (preview, no issue) and `force=true` (re-report).\n- `GET /gitee-ai/scan` retur"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ns the prompt catalog, scan jobs and dedup stats.\n- Scan issues are titled with a `[安全扫描]` prefix."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Security notes"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- User configuration is persisted to the **user's own profile patch layer**; the shipped\n`cordis.pat"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ch.yml` contains only an empty default and never a token.\n- The token is marked secret in the schema"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" and is never echoed by the status/config API\n(only a `tokenConfigured` boolean).\n- The plugin runs "},{"id":"p21s4","text":"with the same privileges as your dsh process; its worker agent gets\n`danger-full-access` inside the "},{"id":"p21s5","text":"cloned workspace only.\n- The scan worker is read-only static analysis; hardcoded-secret findings rep"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"ort type and\nlocation only, never the secret value."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## DSH compatibility (v1.3.1)"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"v1.3.1 fixes \"plugin loads fine but every worker/scan fails\" on DSH 0.2.x. All three are\nfollow-ups "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"to host API changes:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **shell execution**: 0.2.x dropped `shell.run()`; use\n`shell.execute(shell.resolve(req)).result()`"},{"id":"p24s2","text":". The old code threw\n`shell.run is not a function`.\n- **agent preset registration**: 0.2.x `agentPre"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"sets` only honours an explicit\n`register(definition)` and no longer scans `$DSH_HOME/.agent-presets`"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"; the old code threw\n`Unknown agent preset: gitee-scanner`. The plugin now both registers in code an"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"d writes\nthe preset directory (compatibility with older builds).\n- **persona config field**: `@deeps"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"eek-ai/dsh-persona` takes its body as `prefix`\n(required), not `text`; `text` threw `$.prefix missin"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"` takes its body as `prefix`\n(required), not `text`; `text` threw `$.prefix missing required value`."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"After upgrading, **restart the DSH process**. The plugin is installed as an npm package and\na runnin"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"g process never re-imports new code from disk — toggling the plugin on/off is not\nenough."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
